Package: desktop-pkg
Version: 0.0.0
Section: metapackages
Priority: important
Architecture: all
Maintainer: axjab <axjab@github.com>
Description: Desktop tools and dependencies
 Installs the shared core package together with monitor controls,
 desktop portals, and Wayland utilities.
Depends: core,
